  "limitations": [
    "These are published population summaries, not linked observations from individual participants.",
    "Kovacs et al. pool heterogeneous historical exercise protocols; exact workloads were not reported for the three aggregate stages and are therefore omitted.",
    "Wolsk et al. report cardiac index. Absolute mean flow is derived by multiplying each age-stratum mean by the reported stratum mean body surface area of 1.9 m2.",
    "A reported 95% confidence interval describes uncertainty around the population mean and is not an individual physiological tolerance interval.",
    "Upright Kovacs and supine Wolsk series must be interpreted separately; they are not merged into one trajectory.",
    "No model parameter is fitted to either validation source. Subject-level independent validation remains a later, higher-resolution evidence tier.",
    "Representative ages are predeclared band midpoints (29.5, 49.5, and 70 years); they select independently calibrated age bands and are not fitted to validation outcomes."
  ]
